OL,3,GNEWSAWaste of money or worth the wait?
OL,4,AMarket traders and shoppers weigh in
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarket traders in Huddersfield are
OL,7,Fselling their wares from a temporary
OL,8,Fstructure while their Grade II*-listed
OL,9,Fhome undergoes a #16.5m overhaul.
OL,10,FPeople on social media have likened the
OL,11,Finterim site to a "cowshed" - but what
OL,12,Fdo shoppers and sellers really make of
OL,13,Ftheir current home?
OL,15,F"My first customer told me she thought
OL,16,Fit was nice," says Fatoumata Sillah,
OL,17,Fwho relocated to the metal warehouse
OL,18,Fafter six years selling African
OL,19,Ffabrics, turbans and Arabian perfumes
OL,20,Felsewhere in the city.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
