OL,3,GNEWSAWaste of money or worth the wait?
OL,4,AMarket traders and shoppers weigh in
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It is a bit spread out," she adds,
OL,7,Freferencing the new layout; beyond the
OL,8,Ftemporary space, tables with blue and
OL,9,Fwhite or yellow canopies line Brook
OL,10,FStreet and Bryan Street.
OL,12,F"It is not more comfortable but as long
OL,13,Fas we have a roof I think it is OK to
OL,14,Fwait."
